<p>In the latest development in the escalating Hezbollah–Israel conflict, the UN said evacuation orders and Israeli strikes have driven roughly 700,000 people from their homes in Lebanon in just over a week — including more than 100,000 in a single day. Lebanon’s disaster management unit reported 759,300 people registered as displaced, with about 122,600 staying in government shelters, as fresh strikes hit Beirut’s southern suburbs and other areas after evacuation warnings. Fighting has also reached central Beirut in recent days. Reports described strikes hitting residential buildings and a luxury hotel, with differing accounts of who was targeted. Aid agencies warned that overcrowded shelters and host homes can raise public-health risks and disrupt routine care, even as many families rely on community networks and stay with relatives and friends when they can. Some residents have voiced rare public criticism of Hezbollah as repeated displacement upends daily life. Israel says it is striking Hezbollah-linked targets and operatives as the wider regional escalation continues.</p><img src='https://kagiproxy.com/img/BaorEUw4Fb7rjYq6yCsQ3tCOiVY0q68fi27TPRaA6FgEvTqlYh4ZCaqvvJE2VUVOMkjRaHWpQTNb5j59RyKmVDXgLRfbzrDfTHSS69pdoEI2ovy-QeEhFVaBr--jS0e8NNPZi4KkDG4euAAzmBc_XtGYq6ycbixbPi-oW49NK7w3AHYJhzyXrmhc-etrzilKk76AFNHL-Rh8eTEXXmfB' alt='Smoke rises from an Israeli airstrike in Beirut, Lebanon, on Tuesday.' /><br /><h3>Highlights:</h3><ul><li>Where people fled: UNHCR said many families fled within minutes, heading toward Beirut, Mount Lebanon, northern districts, and parts of the Beqaa — often carrying almost nothing.</li><li>Registration figures: UNHCR said more than 667,000 people had registered as displaced on the Lebanese government’s online platform, while Lebanon’s disaster management unit later put the registered total at 759,300.</li><li>Central Beirut strike: Lebanese state media said an Israeli strike hit an apartment building in central Beirut. Reuters said there was no immediate Israeli military comment and no immediate reports of casualties at the time.</li><li>Prior strike in Beirut: Reuters said an earlier strike in Beirut on Sunday killed five members of Iran’s Islamic Revolutionary Guard Corps.</li><li>Political ripple: DW reported Lebanon postponed parliamentary elections as the escalation deepened and displacement grew.</li></ul><blockquote>Lives have been upended on a massive scale - Karolina Lindholm Billing</blockquote><h3>Perspectives:</h3><ul><li>UNHCR: UNHCR said evacuation warnings and strikes forced families across Lebanon to flee within minutes, often with few belongings, as lives are upended by the speed of the flight. (<a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1980752/mideast-war-displaces-100000-in-lebanon-in-single-day-un'>Dawn</a>)</li><li>Lebanese authorities: Lebanon’s disaster management unit described a large-scale response focused on online displacement registration and the opening of government-run collective shelters, even as strikes continue after evacuation warnings. (<a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/fresh-israeli-strikes-hit-lebanon-after-evacuation-warnings'>Al-Monitor</a>)</li><li>Israel and Iran: Israel said a Beirut strike targeted Quds Force operatives; Iran disputed that and said those killed were diplomats. (<a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c2k8y7vy78no'>BBC</a>)</li><li>Displaced Lebanese residents: ABC News reported that some longtime Hezbollah supporters have openly blamed the group as families flee again amid Israeli strikes in southern Lebanon. (<a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/lebanons-latest-conflict-brings-rare-public-backlash-hezbollah-130957819'>ABC News</a>)</li></ul><h3>Sources:</h3><ul><li><a href='https://www.dawn.com/news/1980752/mideast-war-displaces-100000-in-lebanon-in-single-day-un'>Mideast war displaces 100,000 in Lebanon in single day: UN</a> - dawn.com</li><li><a href='https://www.aljazeera.com/video/newsfeed/2026/3/11/beirut-building-ablaze-after-apparent-israeli-strike'>Beirut building ablaze after apparent Israeli strike</a> - aljazeera.com</li><li><a href='https://abcnews.com/International/wireStory/lebanons-latest-conflict-brings-rare-public-backlash-hezbollah-130957819'>Lebanon&#x27;s latest conflict brings rare public backlash against Hezbollah as war flares again</a> - abcnews.com</li><li><a href='https://www.straitstimes.com/world/middle-east/israel-launches-new-strikes-on-beiruts-southern-suburbs'>Israel launches new strikes on Beirut’s southern suburbs</a> - straitstimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.dw.com/en/lebanese-brace-for-more-war-as-hezbollah-israel-attacks-escalate/a-76293444'>Lebanese brace for more war as Hezbollah-Israel attacks escalate</a> - dw.com</li><li><a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/03/10/world/middleeast/lebanon-evacuations-israel-strikes-bombing.html'>Nearly 700,000 Displaced by War in Lebanon, U.N. Says</a> - nytimes.com</li><li><a href='https://www.youtube.com/shorts/dzrUxARvhjw'>Israeli strikes pound south of Beirut, displacing more than 100,000 in a day • FRANCE 24 English</a> - youtube.com</li><li><a href='https://www.al-monitor.com/originals/2026/03/israel-strikes-apartment-building-central-beirut-lebanese-state-media-say'>Israel strikes apartment building in central Beirut, Lebanese state media say</a> - al-monitor.com</li><li><a href='https://www.bbc.com/news/articles/c2k8y7vy78no'>War expands to central Beirut as Israeli strike kills Iranians in luxury hotel</a> - bbc.com</li></ul>